{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>חונן</b> — because the servants of Achish surrounded him, and HaShem sent an angel to deliver him, as in: \"He shall send His angel before you.\"" "And the sense of סביב — for the sense of מלאך there is the species, like: \"I had ox and donkey.\" And so the sense is many angels, as written in the words of Elisha, and even though they are not seen in the vision of the eye, they are known in the heart in truth."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:26.061148102Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}